      "Language": "pol",
      "Abstract": {"AbstractText": "A case of 74-years-old woman who was admitted to Department of Interventional Cardiology due to acute coronary syndrome is presented. The multilevel atherosclerosis was diagnosed. The patient was successfully treated with two-stage percutaneous coronary and peripheral revascularisation. During 6-months follow-up patient was in good condition."},
